{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T07:39:43+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-29T07:39:43+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Derichebourg SA","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Waste Management","country":"France","city":"Paris","website":"https://www.derichebourg.com","employees":5256,"summary":"Derichebourg SA provides environmental services to businesses, and local and municipal authorities. The company engages in the collection, management and reuse of end-of-life capital and consumer goods, production, and industrial waste; and waste collection, urban cleaning, waste collection center management, water management. It is also involved in the production and distribution of drinking water; collection and treatment of wastewater; consumer management; and treatment of xenobiotics, as well as collection and recovery of residential waste. The company was founded in 1956 and is based in Paris, France.","exchange":"Paris","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Derichebourg SA fournit des services environnementaux aux entreprises et aux autorités locales et municipales. La société s'engage dans la collecte, la gestion et la réutilisation des biens d'équipement et de consommation en fin de vie, la production et les déchets industriels; et la collecte des déchets, le nettoyage urbain, la gestion des centres de collecte des déchets, la gestion de l'eau. Il est également impliqué dans la production et la distribution d'eau potable, la collecte et le traitement des eaux usées, la gestion des consommateurs, le traitement des xénobiotiques, ainsi que la collecte et la récupération des déchets résidentiels."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":1228081920,"shares_outstanding":158257962,"trailing_pe":9.349398,"forward_pe":7.418029,"price_to_book":1.0446957,"ev_to_ebitda":7.892,"ev_to_revenue":0.544,"dividend_yield":0.0167,"payout_ratio":0.1566,"beta_yahoo":1.8},"t